# Pre-filing patent material. A public repo is a public disclosure, and in India (and at the
# EPO) that destroys novelty with no grace period. These stay local until the application
# has a filing date. patent_draft.md is the full specification with the claim set, so it is
# the single most damaging file here if it is ever pushed.
CipherFlow_IDF.docx
CipherFlow_IDF.pdf
*_IDF.docx
*_IDF.pdf
cipherflow/deliverables/patent_draft.md

